SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:30pm\, 7pm\nShortly before the 1973 Chilean coup\, CIA
  agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by the
 ir bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and as the lon
 gtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies\, Ch
 ris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send e
 veryone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.imagescine
 ma.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.c
 ity/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
