SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Following the deaths of Mihai's parents\, Mihai and Lisbeth Ghe
 orghiu leave their life behind in Romania and move with their children to 
 a remote village in Norway\, hoping to rebuild their lives near Lisbeth's 
 family. There\, they grow close to their neighbors\, the Halbergs\, whose 
 warmth gives them hope for a fresh start. But the fragile peace begins to 
 unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s young daughter\, Elia\, arrives at s
 chool covered in bruises.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/fjord\nFrom Pu
 shpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/fjord
END:VEVENT
