DTSTART:20261129T000000Z
DTEND:20261129T020000Z
SUMMARY:Sherlock Jr.
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Witness some of the most mind-boggling stunts — and biggest l
 aughs — in movie history when we screen Buster Keaton’s Sherlock\, Jr.
  with a live score performed by Joanna Seaton and Donald Sosin on November
  28th! A benefit screening presented in partnership with Christ Trinity Ch
 urch of Sheffield to raise money for Berkshire Bounty\, join us for a prog
 ram that includes a singalong of songs from 1924\, a slideshow of famous S
 herlocks\, an additional Buster Keaton short film\, and Keaton’s iconic 
 feature about a projectionist who dreams he’s a world famous detective.\
 nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/sherlock-jr\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/sherlock-jr
END:VEVENT
